    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d917-a1">

                <pb facs="1082" n="986" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg986"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: With reference to your
                    communications of 7th and 9th instants, respectively, I have the honor to inform
                    you that the Governor-General of Canada has reported that nothing has been seen
                    or heard of a Spanish privateer seeking a pilot in Canadian waters. His
                    excellency adds that the rumor is believed to be without foundation.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. H. Villiers</hi></signed>,<lb/>(For
                    the Marquis of Salisbury.)</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
